{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/cor-mass-identity-C","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Corollary","doco:Section"],"label":"cor:mass-identity-C","kind":"corollary","title":"Archimedean realisation: nonabelian multiplicative integration","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-c-quantum-observable-universe","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-mass-identity"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-mass-identity-C"],"cites":["references/yekutieli2015"],"tags":["archimedean","mass","multiplicative-integral","yekutieli"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.MassIdentityC","text":"mass-identity-C.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/mass-identity-C.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"cor:mass-identity-C\"></a><p>Consider the archimedean quantum observable universe <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, \\varTheta, G, \\mathcal{S})</code> (<a href=\"#ex:c-quantum-observable-universe\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{C}</code>-quantum observable universe</a>) with instanton connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>, Levi form <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L</code>, and self-dual curvature <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F^+</code>. We realise the categorical mass (<a href=\"#def:mass-identity\">mass identity</a>) as Yekutieli's nonabelian multiplicative integral <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"yekutieli2015\">[yekutieli2015]</span>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/mass-identity-C.md","heading":"Corollary","number":"8.1.7"}
